dict(when='2026-10-30 23:51',who='Magazine Haïti (@maghaiti), citing Arcahaie Mayor Wilner René on Radio Télé Caraïbes',where='X, Bercy, between Cabaret and Arcahaie',url='https://x.com/maghaiti/status/2116286990404501637',text='The Cabaret gang leader known as "Galaxie" and about ten of his men were killed by kamikaze drone strikes on Thursday 29 Oct in an operation by the Haitian police and the Task Force at Bercy, between Cabaret and Arcahaie. The mayor said on Radio Télé Caraïbes\'s "Gran Boulva" news that other gang members fled, causing tension in nearby places including Lévêque. Le Nouvelliste (30 Oct), citing a local source, also says the police, "backed by the Task Force," killed several gang members including Galaxie. Radiographie says at least ten were killed and that police armored vehicles pushing into Lévêque emptied the Cabaret market.',evidence="Named official (the mayor) on radio; one photo; Le Nouvelliste's local source not named",other='Another source says: HaitiInfoProj credits the police with the Arcahaie brigade; Rolfy Martínez credits the police, the Gang Suppression Force and El Salvador and says about 15 were killed; @FouyeRasinNou cites a police source via Le Facteur Haïti for about ten. Only Magazine Haïti mentions kamikaze drones.',links=[['Le Nouvelliste, operation at Bercy', 'https://lenouvelliste.com/article/273482/plusieurs-bandits-tues-dans-une-operation-des-forces-de-lordre-a-bercy'], ['Radiographie', 'https://radiographieht.com/un-chef-de-gang-et-une-dizaine-de-ses-soldats-abattus-a-arcahaie/'], ['@FouyeRasinNou, citing Le Facteur Haïti', 'https://x.com/FouyeRasinNou/status/2116284210399072556']]),
