dict(when='2026-10-30 06:58',who='Drop Site News (@DropSiteNews), via PassBlue; UNA-Haiti open letter',where='X and teleSUR, Croix-des-Bouquets and Canaan',url='https://x.com/DropSiteNews/status/2116031975630782900',text='UNA-Haiti, a diaspora group (not part of the UN), wrote to Secretary-General Guterres on 29 Oct that Salvadoran forces have hit civilian areas of Croix-des-Bouquets, Canaan and the Cul-de-Sac plain since 22 Oct with air strikes, helicopter gunships and heavy weapons: "Children are being killed not by gangs, but by foreign bombs." It says families are "hiding under beds" and asks for a halt and a UN investigation.',evidence='Open letter; no named victims, photos or video in the letter as reported',other='Not yet reported by others on the ground; no Haitian outlet we checked reports Salvadoran air strikes.',links=[['teleSUR, 30 Oct', 'https://www.telesurtv.net/una-haiti-operaciones-militares-el-salvador/']]),
dict(when='2026-10-30 06:00',who='Listín Diario (Miguel Vólquez) and Diario Libre, Dominican dailies',where='Jimaní, Dominican Republic',url='https://listindiario.com/la-republica/provincias/20261030/siete-helicopteros-salvador-llegan-jimani_928118.html',text='Seven military helicopters stopped on 29 Oct at the 14th Infantry Battalion heliport in Jimaní, 53 km from Port-au-Prince: five Salvadoran MD500Es (numbers 48, 49, 52, 53 and 54) at about 3 p.m. and two Black Hawks at 4:10 p.m. Dominican troops refueled and checked them and their weapons were fitted; all seven left for Haiti at 5 p.m. Diario Libre says the MD500Es were flown from San Salvador to Santo Domingo in a National Airlines Boeing 747-400, and Foreign Minister Bisonó says the Dominican Republic helps with transit, equipment, medical evacuations and blood but sends no troops into combat.',evidence='Reporter on the scene with photos (Listín); a security report seen by Diario Libre',other='César Moreno had posted video of five of the helicopters at Jimaní the night before.',links=[['Diario Libre, 30 Oct', 'https://www.diariolibre.com/actualidad/nacional/2026/10/30/rd-facilita-apoyo-a-despliegue-militar-de-el-salvador-en-haiti/3705388'], ['Magazine Haïti', 'https://x.com/maghaiti/status/2116264124112052322']]),
