dict(when='2026-10-30 04:44',who="Diario El Mundo (El Salvador), Bukele press conference with Peru's President Keiko Fujimori",where='San Salvador',url='https://diario.elmundo.sv/politica/bukele-si-nos-entregan-a-nuestros-aerotecnicos-vivos-ese-mismo-dia-nos-regresamos-de-haiti',text='Bukele said the mission is "not to finish off the gangs of Haiti, but to rescue" the four technicians, and that if they are handed over alive "that same day we go home in the afternoon." Otherwise: "if they don\'t hand them over the easy way, we will rescue them the hard way, and along the way we will finish them off." He said the four were medical evacuation technicians and "not a valid military target," and that El Salvador has no interest in Haiti\'s resources.',evidence="Bukele's own words at a press conference (29 Oct, evening in San Salvador)",other='',links=[]),
