 ("Police 37th class, 30 Oct","1,189 including 242 women (Prime Minister's office) / 1,192 (police); P-4000 total more than 3,200 (US Embassy)"),
 ("Killed in the 29 Oct Bercy operation","about ten (Arcahaie mayor via Magazine Haïti; Radiographie) / about 15 (Rolfy Martínez) / at least a dozen (Franklin Vargas, citing Erikpr News)"),
 ("People displaced in Petite Rivière and Verrettes, 19 to 26 Oct","13,912 in 3,316 households (IOM, 29 Oct)"),
 ("Bukele approval, CID Gallup poll 24 to 27 Oct","94 percent approve; 82 percent worried about the risk to personnel in Haiti"),
 ("Drone strikes by Haiti's task force and contractors since Mar 2025","more than 2,000 (CNN, 17 Oct); 85 civilians killed by drones (UN, via CNN)"),
